tiny/ and tiny-reference.json are copied unchanged from b0xtch/laya-candle
(https://github.com/b0xtch/laya-candle, commit b940914a8c4980b29f45b510692bb235710b5568,
tests/fixtures/), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

They are a deterministic *synthetic* checkpoint (4-layer ModernBERT, hidden 64,
random weights, 47-word WordLevel tokenizer) and its golden outputs, generated
by that project's tests/reference.py with upstream Laya
(https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya, commit 42626c348753fbb17572a813127df2278a1ec527),
PyTorch 2.14.0, Transformers 5.0.0, CPU float32. They contain no pretrained weights.

